    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκ-βᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without outlet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαράσρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.98
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄϊδος εὐνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.392
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not 'coming off',</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνειρος,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβαίνειν,</span>
			<i>Cat.Cod. Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				5(3).89.31
			</span></i>.</div>
